### 3. Lead Stage Pipeline
Every student moves through the following pipeline. Each stage change should be logged as an interaction.

| Stage | Description | Trigger |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **New Lead** | Just entered the system | Form submission, walk-in, DM |
| **Contacted** | First outreach made | Call placed / WhatsApp sent |
| **Counselling Done** | Full profile captured, goals set | Counselling session completed |
| **Docs Collection** | Gathering SOP, transcripts, LORs | Counsellor requests documents |
| **Applied** | Applications submitted to universities | At least 1 application filed |
| **Offer Received** | Offer letter in hand | University responds positively |
| **Visa Filed** | Visa application submitted | Visa docs submitted to embassy |
| **Enrolled** | Student has confirmed enrolment | Enrollment confirmed |
| **Lost / Dropped** | Student not proceeding | Student unresponsive or chose competitor |

