### 10. Key Technology Decisions

| Layer | Recommended | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL | Relational — suits FK-heavy CRM structure; easy to query across entities |
| **Backend** | Node.js + Express OR Python FastAPI | FastAPI preferred if team knows Python; Node if JS-first |
| **Frontend** | React (web) | Mobile-responsive; role-based views per counsellor |
| **Auth** | Role-based (RBAC) | Admin / Counsellor / Visa Exec — field-level visibility control |
| **File Storage** | AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2 | For all uploaded documents, offer letters, invoices |
| **Notifications** | WhatsApp API (WATI / Interakt) | Automated follow-up reminders; key for Indian market |
| **Email** | SendGrid / Resend | Offer letter emails, fee receipts, status updates |
| **Hosting** | Railway / AWS / GCP | Railway for MVP; AWS for scale |

