| **Student** | Document Checklist | One student → many documents |
| **Student** | Payment | One student → many payment records |
| **Application** | Document Checklist | One application → specific document set |
| **Counsellor** | Student | One counsellor → many assigned students |
| **University Master** | Application | One university → referenced in many applications |

